<p>The biggest mistake is consuming content without acting on it. Each expert on this list publishes tactics that can be implemented immediately. Create a system for capturing ideas and scheduling implementation. A single insight from Darren Shaw on citation building or Amanda Jordan on local link opportunities can transform your local visibility.</p>
